{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x24---lemon-of-troy",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x24 - Lemon of Troy",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x24 - Lemon of Troy.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:11.181Z",
  "lineCount": 289,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Lemon of Troy",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2805,
      "endMs": 4617
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "\"Wet cement.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 34617,
      "endMs": 36027
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Is there any sweeter sign? Well, maybe \"high voltage.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 36228,
      "endMs": 39483
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Hello, son. You want to try this flying motorcycle I just invented?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44013,
      "endMs": 47705
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "No time. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47872,
      "endMs": 49953
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "This is for the ages.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 52134,
      "endMs": 54953
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Like Stonehenge, this site will forever be a mystery.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 56597,
      "endMs": 59550
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Who was Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61161,
      "endMs": 62436
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "And how did he manage to write his name in solid cement?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 62604,
      "endMs": 65423
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "He must've been smarter than his sister Lisa, about whom we know nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65624,
      "endMs": 69181
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Say, let's bring him back to life by using technology.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69349,
      "endMs": 72000
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Ay caramba!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73107,
      "endMs": 74416
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "What's normal to him amazes us. He will be our new god.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81295,
      "endMs": 85221
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Good, somebody's shadow. I'll just turn and brag about my work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91799,
      "endMs": 94819
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Bart, you've graffito-tagged public property.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96128,
      "endMs": 99081
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "It was an accident.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 99282,
      "endMs": 100960
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I can't believe you vandalized your own hometown, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 101463,
      "endMs": 104013
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "What would Jebediah Springfield say? He'd be cool with it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104181,
      "endMs": 107101
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Homer, will you please help me make a big deal of this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107302,
      "endMs": 110154
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "What for? Nobody cared when Bogart defaced that sidewalk in Hollywood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110356,
      "endMs": 114215
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Well, I'm just shocked by this whole family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 114450,
      "endMs": 117034
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Whatever happened to good old-fashioned town pride?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117201,
      "endMs": 119685
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "It's been going down since the lake caught fire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119919,
      "endMs": 122235
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Now, just a darn minute. This town is a part of who you are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122436,
      "endMs": 126698
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "This is a Springfield Isotopes cap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126866,
      "endMs": 129852
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "When you wear it, you're wearing Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130020,
      "endMs": 132940
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "When you eat a fish from our river, you're eating Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133175,
      "endMs": 136664
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "When you make lemonade from our trees, you're drinking Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136832,
      "endMs": 141631
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Mom, when you give that lecture, you're boring Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141866,
      "endMs": 144785
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "You have roots in this town, and you ought to show respect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144987,
      "endMs": 147772
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "This town is a part of us all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147973,
      "endMs": 149383
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "A part of us all. A part of us all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149550,
      "endMs": 151966
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Sorry to repeat myself, but it'll help you remember.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152168,
      "endMs": 154685
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "This town is a part of us all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 156262,
      "endMs": 158175
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "A part of us all. A part of us all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158376,
      "endMs": 160691
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Wow, that does work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 160859,
      "endMs": 162705
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "When it comes to catching trout, nothing beats the German light infantry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167758,
      "endMs": 171785
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Beautiful, aren't they?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171953,
      "endMs": 173228
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Yep. I'm gonna huck them at cars.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173396,
      "endMs": 176617
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Hey, Milhouse. How's the lemonade business?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181550,
      "endMs": 183530
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "It's clearly booming, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183698,
      "endMs": 186383
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I don't even want any. I just bought a pity glass.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187725,
      "endMs": 190443
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "We've squozen our whole supply. To the lemon tree!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190611,
      "endMs": 194168
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Thar she grows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204436,
      "endMs": 207154
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "You know, Milhouse, I've been thinking. This town ain't so bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210007,
      "endMs": 213631
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Good friends, lots of lemons, numerous angel sightings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213799,
      "endMs": 217121
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "When you get right down to it, Springfield's a pretty cool place to live.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217322,
      "endMs": 221081
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Springfield sucks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221248,
      "endMs": 223161
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Hey, stop talking bad about my town, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224839,
      "endMs": 226987
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Why don't you make me. I don't make trash, I burn it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227154,
      "endMs": 229705
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Then I guess you're a garbage man. I know you are, but what am I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229906,
      "endMs": 233128
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "A garbage man. Oh, I know you are, but what am I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233329,
      "endMs": 235812
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "A garbage man. I know you are, but what am I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236013,
      "endMs": 238497
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "A garbage man. Takes one to know one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238732,
      "endMs": 240846
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Checkmate. Hey, kid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242054,
      "endMs": 243732
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Stop wearing your backpack over one shoulder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 243899,
      "endMs": 245980
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "We invented that. Copycat. You copied us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246181,
      "endMs": 249906
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Step over this line and say that. I'll kick your butt...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250107,
      "endMs": 253362
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "...at Nintendo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253530,
      "endMs": 254805
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "I just put a rock in your crummy town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255711,
      "endMs": 258027
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "That's a crud rock. It belongs in Crudtown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258262,
      "endMs": 261315
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Look at the weak little baby. You're stupid, you stupid, weak baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265040,
      "endMs": 270242
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Come on, let's get out of here. Hey, they're taking our lemons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270409,
      "endMs": 273664
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "We can't spare a single one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273832,
      "endMs": 275644
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "You just got citric acid in my eye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280007,
      "endMs": 282993
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "You'll pay for that, Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283161,
      "endMs": 285946
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Some things never change.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288060,
      "endMs": 290208
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Hey, everybody, an old man's talking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290409,
      "endMs": 292557
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Grampa's the name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294906,
      "endMs": 296785
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Did you know this tree dates back to frontier times?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296987,
      "endMs": 301416
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Shut up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 303966,
      "endMs": 305242
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "It all began when Jebediah Springfield first came to these lands...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 306143,
      "endMs": 310606
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "...with his partner, Shelbyville Manhattan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310774,
      "endMs": 315002
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "People, our search is over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319868,
      "endMs": 321781
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "On this site, we shall build a new town, where we can worship freely...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 321982,
      "endMs": 325338
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "...govern justly and grow vast fields of hemp for making rope and blankets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325505,
      "endMs": 329666
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Yes, and marry our cousins. I was...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329834,
      "endMs": 332955
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "What are you talking about, Shelbyville? Why would we marry our cousins?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 333123,
      "endMs": 336747
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Because they're so attractive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336915,
      "endMs": 338425
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "I thought that was the whole point of this journey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338593,
      "endMs": 340908
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Absolutely not. I tell you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341109,
      "endMs": 342687
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "...I won't live in a town that robs men of the right to marry their cousins.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342854,
      "endMs": 346411
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Well, then we'll form our own town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346613,
      "endMs": 348895
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Who will come and live a life devoted to chastity, abstinence...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349062,
      "endMs": 352787
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "...and a flavorless mush I call rootmarm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352989,
      "endMs": 355707
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "The town of Springfield was born on that day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364968,
      "endMs": 368660
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "And to mark that sweet moment, our people planted this lemon tree...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368895,
      "endMs": 373928
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "...lemons being the sweetest fruit available at the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374163,
      "endMs": 377452
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Those Shelbyville kids think they're hot. You know what? They're not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381579,
      "endMs": 384801
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I really agree with you on this one, Bart. Class, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384935,
      "endMs": 388123
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "If you don't learn Roman numerals...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388324,
      "endMs": 389968
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "...you'll never know when movies were copyrighted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390136,
      "endMs": 392418
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Come quick. Something's happened. No time to explain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392653,
      "endMs": 395371
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "No, children. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 395572,
      "endMs": 397619
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Your education is important. Roman numerals, et cetera.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397821,
      "endMs": 401445
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Whatever. I tried.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401613,
      "endMs": 403895
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Are you sure it wouldn't be faster to just tell us what happened?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406948,
      "endMs": 409935
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "No. I said there's no time to explain, and I stick by that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410103,
      "endMs": 414130
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "The lemon tree's gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 416109,
      "endMs": 417787
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "And the tracks appear to lead into Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418458,
      "endMs": 420841
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Oh, look, a clue. A candy-bar wrapper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421076,
      "endMs": 423526
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Oh, they're always eating candy in Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 423693,
      "endMs": 426713
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "They love the sweet taste. We gotta get that tree back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426881,
      "endMs": 430237
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "You mean going to Shelbyville? We'll never make it out alive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431138,
      "endMs": 434964
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "That lemon tree's part of our town and, as kids, the backbone of our economy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435132,
      "endMs": 439460
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "We'll get it back or choke their rivers with our dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439662,
      "endMs": 442984
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Hey, Milhouse, get your invasion supplies, and let's go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444858,
      "endMs": 448046
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Get him. Come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453449,
      "endMs": 454926
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Where did he go? Over here, my friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457946,
      "endMs": 460530
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Or is it over here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460697,
      "endMs": 463919
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466805,
      "endMs": 468315
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Here's how it goes. I'm the leader. Milhouse is my loyal sidekick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469959,
      "endMs": 473013
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Nelson's the tough guy. Martin's the smart guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473181,
      "endMs": 475295
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Todd's the religious guy who ends up going crazy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 475462,
      "endMs": 477711
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "And now...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477912,
      "endMs": 479053
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "...the time has come to cross this line into mystery and danger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 479221,
      "endMs": 483113
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "To step out of childhood and become men.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483315,
      "endMs": 486771
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "If you get lost, remember...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499120,
      "endMs": 501201
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "...you can always find east by staring directly at the sun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501402,
      "endMs": 505395
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Here's a tip. Put a pinch of sage in your boots...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505597,
      "endMs": 508181
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "...and all day long, a spicy scent is your reward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508315,
      "endMs": 511972
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Oh, my gosh. Look.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513214,
      "endMs": 514926
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "The fire hydrants here are yellow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515093,
      "endMs": 517543
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "This place is starting to freak me out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517744,
      "endMs": 520026
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Danger coming. Behind us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520261,
      "endMs": 523516
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "What is it, boy? Is there something behind that wall we should beat up?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524959,
      "endMs": 528214
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "No time to check it out now. We've got lemonade to sell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528382,
      "endMs": 532409
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Radical.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534187,
      "endMs": 535630
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "They're getting rich off us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536469,
      "endMs": 537979
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "And that kid with the backpack said \"radical.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538181,
      "endMs": 540261
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "I say \"radical.\" That's my thing that I say.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540429,
      "endMs": 543818
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "I feel like I'm gonna explode here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544053,
      "endMs": 546972
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "It's lunchtime. Do you know where your brother's tutoring?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549321,
      "endMs": 552207
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Tutoring? The only thing Bart's teaching is guerrilla combat in Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552811,
      "endMs": 556670
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "You have a number we can reach him? No, Mom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556905,
      "endMs": 559288
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Bart and some kids ran off to wage war on Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559456,
      "endMs": 562241
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Homer, come quick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563852,
      "endMs": 565462
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Bart's quit his tutoring job and joined a violence gang.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 565630,
      "endMs": 568516
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "The trail has become indistinct.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571398,
      "endMs": 573546
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "I suggest we split up to cover more ground.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 573713,
      "endMs": 576734
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Good idea. Milhouse, you and me will be Omega Team.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 576901,
      "endMs": 579519
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Todd, you and Data are Team Strike Force.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579687,
      "endMs": 582069
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Nelson, that leaves you and Martin. Team Discovery Channel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582270,
      "endMs": 586633
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Your wussiness better come in handy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 587572,
      "endMs": 590492
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "What's going on? I want some answers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 593948,
      "endMs": 595794
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Okay, folks, look, I called the police captain in Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595995,
      "endMs": 598982
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "He says he hasn't seen our kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599116,
      "endMs": 600626
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "But if they show up in the morgue, he's gonna fax us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 600794,
      "endMs": 603177
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Oh, man, I hate those Shelbyville jerks. Honey, I was born in Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 603411,
      "endMs": 607740
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "And it tears me up inside.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607908,
      "endMs": 609720
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "This is my fault. I tried to teach Bart about town pride.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609921,
      "endMs": 613109
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "But the power of my words filled him with a sort of madness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613277,
      "endMs": 616264
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Marge, you can't blame all of Bart's problems on your one little speech.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 616432,
      "endMs": 621398
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "If anything turned him bad...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621566,
      "endMs": 623143
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "...it's that time you let him wear a bathing suit instead of underwear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623277,
      "endMs": 626532
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "And let's not forget your little speech. Isn't there anything we can do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626700,
      "endMs": 631297
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Yes, there is. Come on, everybody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631465,
      "endMs": 633982
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Let's go into Shelbyville and get those kids back ourselves.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634150,
      "endMs": 637740
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "I got an RV we can use.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637908,
      "endMs": 639586
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Flanders'. Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639787,
      "endMs": 641499
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Yeah, let's do it. Okay, but just go a little bit easy on it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641666,
      "endMs": 644888
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Pile in, everybody. No time to wipe your feet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645022,
      "endMs": 647103
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647304,
      "endMs": 648277
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Okay, piglet, start squealing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651566,
      "endMs": 653646
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Where'd you get the lemons for this lemonade?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653814,
      "endMs": 656062
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "This is Country Time Lemonade Mix.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656880,
      "endMs": 658759
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "There's never been anything close to a lemon in it. I swear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 658927,
      "endMs": 661981
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Hey. Nobody hassles my little brother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662149,
      "endMs": 664766
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Hey. And no one manhandles the bosom chum of Nelson Muntz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664934,
      "endMs": 668759
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Spring forth, burly protector, and save me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668927,
      "endMs": 672048
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Jeez.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676041,
      "endMs": 677316
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "I never hang out with him, normally.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677484,
      "endMs": 680639
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Hark to the tale of Nelson And the boy he loved so dear They remained the best of friends For years and years and years",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682014,
      "endMs": 689531
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "What are they saying? I'm not sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689733,
      "endMs": 692384
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "I thought you said you could read lips. I assumed I could.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692551,
      "endMs": 695471
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "It's no use, Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695672,
      "endMs": 697014
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "If we're gonna find that lemon tree, I've got to go undercover.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697182,
      "endMs": 700102
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "What I need is a new face. You leave that to the baron and me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700236,
      "endMs": 703625
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Hello there, fellow Shelbyvillians.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707484,
      "endMs": 709800
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 710001,
      "endMs": 711276
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "If you're from Shelbyville, how come we've never seen you at school?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711444,
      "endMs": 714733
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "I don't go to school. Okay, what's two plus two?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714900,
      "endMs": 718323
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Five. Story checks out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718525,
      "endMs": 720303
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "We just got word there's Springfield kids in town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 720504,
      "endMs": 723692
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Curse those handsome devils.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725303,
      "endMs": 726578
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "We're going up to the bluffs to paint \"Springfield sucks\" in huge letters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726746,
      "endMs": 730169
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "That way, whenever they look into Shelbyville, they'll realize that they suck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730337,
      "endMs": 734028
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Radical. Quit copying me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734196,
      "endMs": 737686
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "You know, I wish there was a Springfield kid here right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737887,
      "endMs": 742115
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "I'd fill his mouth with stinkbugs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742283,
      "endMs": 744598
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "No, not in my mouth...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744833,
      "endMs": 746343
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "...is what the kid would say. To the bluffs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746511,
      "endMs": 749565
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Well, a friendly Springfield hello there, neighbors.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752384,
      "endMs": 754867
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "You know, we think some kids of ours may be missing in your town.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755068,
      "endMs": 758424
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Missing children?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758625,
      "endMs": 759934
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Sounds like Springfield's got a discipline problem.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760102,
      "endMs": 762618
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Maybe that's why we beat them at football nearly half the time, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 762820,
      "endMs": 766108
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Quit stalling, kid. Write \"Springfield sucks\" in giant letters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768357,
      "endMs": 771947
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "His can control is excellent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780672,
      "endMs": 783055
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Yes. And that wig makes him look a lot like one of the Beatles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783256,
      "endMs": 787384
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "That's right, the stranger who walks amongst you is me, Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790163,
      "endMs": 794895
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "You know, Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796069,
      "endMs": 797848
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "From Springfield? He's from Springfield. Get him!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799224,
      "endMs": 802479
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "I'll use these spray cans as jetpacks and fly to safety.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813227,
      "endMs": 815878
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "So long, losers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816080,
      "endMs": 818127
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "You're dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822556,
      "endMs": 824569
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Hey, look. Someone's attractive cousin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824737,
      "endMs": 826751
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Where? Where? I don't see anybody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826918,
      "endMs": 829536
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "So he thinks he can out-skateboard me, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834771,
      "endMs": 836885
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Launch me, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837120,
      "endMs": 839838
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Slow down, you sidewalk-surfing cube-gleamers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863026,
      "endMs": 866684
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "\"Wet cement.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873462,
      "endMs": 875073
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "I could sure use that flying motorcycle now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 880543,
      "endMs": 882959
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "You had your chance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 883127,
      "endMs": 885274
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Safe at last.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896012,
      "endMs": 898160
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "\"Caution: Exit through door seven only.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904100,
      "endMs": 907053
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "All other rooms contain man-eating tigers.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 907220,
      "endMs": 910744
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Roman numerals. They never even tried to teach us that in school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912925,
      "endMs": 916382
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Milhouse, what's seven in Roman numerals?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 918059,
      "endMs": 920543
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I'll tell you, but you really should end each transmission with the word \"over.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920744,
      "endMs": 924771
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Over. Correction: The only thing that's over is that transmission.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924939,
      "endMs": 929872
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Is this the untimely end of Milhouse?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930073,
      "endMs": 932556
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "But Milhouse is my name. But I thought I was the only one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933429,
      "endMs": 937288
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "A pain I know all too well.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937455,
      "endMs": 939603
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "So this is what it feels like when doves cry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939838,
      "endMs": 944704
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Milhouse. Milhouse. Now what do I do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944905,
      "endMs": 947187
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Wait. I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948563,
      "endMs": 950106
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "I got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950308,
      "endMs": 951751
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "I don't got it. Okay, think, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951918,
      "endMs": 954167
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Where have you seen Roman numerals before?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954368,
      "endMs": 956885
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "I know. Rocky V. That was the fifth one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957053,
      "endMs": 959637
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "So Rocky V plus Rocky II equals Rocky VII: Adrian's Revenge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959838,
      "endMs": 965610
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Come back here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967489,
      "endMs": 969301
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "It's no use. I'm never gonna find that tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971751,
      "endMs": 974972
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "This whole raid was as useless as that yellow, lemon-shaped rock over there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975890,
      "endMs": 980924
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 981091,
      "endMs": 982366
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "There's a lemon behind that rock.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982534,
      "endMs": 984615
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "The tree!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985991,
      "endMs": 987534
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "A car impound lot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998138,
      "endMs": 1000085
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "The impenetrable fortress of suburbia.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000286,
      "endMs": 1003071
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "We'll never get the tree back now. Keep your voices down, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1003239,
      "endMs": 1006561
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "We didn't get this far to get found out. Found them! You kids are in big trouble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1006729,
      "endMs": 1010722
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Running away from home like this. But they stole our lemon tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010890,
      "endMs": 1013977
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I don't care what excuse you've got.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014179,
      "endMs": 1016595
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Nothing's gonna stop me in the middle of this speech.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016762,
      "endMs": 1019380
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "You're gonna... Lemon tree?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019548,
      "endMs": 1021226
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "That tree's been in Springfield since the time of our forefathers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022635,
      "endMs": 1026091
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Give it back, or we'll bust in there and take it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026259,
      "endMs": 1029615
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Bust in here and take it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1029816,
      "endMs": 1031494
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "You must stupider than you look. Stupider like a fox!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031662,
      "endMs": 1035722
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "I'm okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042668,
      "endMs": 1043977
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Don't you get it, Springfield? It's over. You lose.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1048004,
      "endMs": 1050823
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Now, if you'll excuse me, all this talk has made me hungry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050991,
      "endMs": 1055219
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "This is the darkest day in the history of Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062299,
      "endMs": 1065051
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "If anybody wants me, I'll be in the shower.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065219,
      "endMs": 1067668
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "There's got to be a way to get that tree back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067870,
      "endMs": 1070957
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Hey, look. A hospital.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071125,
      "endMs": 1073373
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Pull in there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073575,
      "endMs": 1074984
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Oh, great. Now I'm upside down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1076762,
      "endMs": 1078944
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Oh, dear, some thoughtless human being has parked in a hospital zone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083519,
      "endMs": 1087177
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "No one in history has ever done anything this clever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103989,
      "endMs": 1108586
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "I'll get the gate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1111741,
      "endMs": 1113486
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "That's okay, son. I'll take care of him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117143,
      "endMs": 1119929
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Faster, son! He's got a taste for meat now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122714,
      "endMs": 1125801
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Get out here, son. There's a-doings a-transpiring.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133586,
      "endMs": 1136405
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Let's shut the gate and seal them in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136606,
      "endMs": 1139325
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Gun it, Flanders.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1139526,
      "endMs": 1141539
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "It won't start. Something's draining the battery.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141774,
      "endMs": 1145197
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1146069,
      "endMs": 1147378
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "We made it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152546,
      "endMs": 1154224
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Eat my shorts, Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155465,
      "endMs": 1157210
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Eat my shorts. Eat my shorts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157412,
      "endMs": 1159425
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Yes, eat all of our shirts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159593,
      "endMs": 1161674
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Oh, you lousy Springfielders, you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161875,
      "endMs": 1164090
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Shake harder, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164257,
      "endMs": 1166472
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "We did it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168116,
      "endMs": 1170130
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171237,
      "endMs": 1173418
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "And with that, a mighty cheer went up from the heroes of Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177378,
      "endMs": 1182378
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "They had brought the sacred tree back to its native soil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182580,
      "endMs": 1185667
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "And though Flanders was stuck with the impound fee...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185835,
      "endMs": 1188653
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "...he could easily afford it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1188821,
      "endMs": 1191707
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "More lemonade, Bart? Absolutely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191908,
      "endMs": 1195734
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Say when.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196271,
      "endMs": 1197378
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "There are over 14 parts of the lemon that are...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1198721,
      "endMs": 1201271
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "And with that, a mighty cheer went up from the heroes of Shelbyville.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1201439,
      "endMs": 1205566
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "They had banished the awful lemon tree forever...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1205767,
      "endMs": 1208586
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "...because it was haunted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1208754,
      "endMs": 1210566
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "Now, let's all celebrate...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1210767,
      "endMs": 1212345
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "...with a cool glass of turnip juice. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212512,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 24
  }
}
